/- English proof (translation)
Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Consider separately whether the proposition holds or fails. Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result.

